# Renders docs/media/p1-hitl-double-execution.gif — run from repo root: vhs docs/media/p1-hitl-double-execution.tape
Output docs/media/p1-hitl-double-execution.gif
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1050
Set Height 520
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Type "uv run python -m examples.live_problems.problem_1_hitl_double_execution 2>/dev/null"
Enter
Sleep 12s
